# Live: type a draft in the composer (no send)

Output out/07-composer-draft.mp4
Output out/07-composer-draft.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 2560
Set Height 1600
Set Padding 10
Set Margin 0
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "./bin/run-spur-tui-live.sh"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@25s /Lineage/
Sleep 1s
Hide
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "draft only - do not send (demo capture)"
Show
Wait+Screen@10s /draft only/
Sleep 2s
